                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.75/17: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Aldridge</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-06-05T18:00:00-04:00">June 5, 1929—6
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>31. Your 48, June 4, 8 p.m., and 49, June 4, 11 p.m. Department is gratified at
                    the results secured by your representations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
